Note on the dictionary data
---------------------------
rules/lexicon.csv is derived from a compiled S'gaw Karen dictionary workbook.
Each row keeps its own source code (MOBI, BFAS-APK, PICDICT95, KTWG, DRUM-WL,
JSS-COLOR, MNKOM, WIKI-LANG) in the `source` column. The copyright above covers
this program and the work of compiling that data; it conveys no rights over the
